OBJECTIVES

The main objective of Eventify is to develop a user-friendly online platform that simplifies event discovery and ticket booking.
To provide an easy and convenient online ticket booking system.
To allow users to browse events and view their details.
To enable users to book tickets quickly and efficiently.
To reduce manual work and save time during ticket booking.
To provide a secure and reliable booking experience.
To simplify event and booking management for organizers.
To improve the overall user experience through a simple interface.
